# Symbolics with SymPy

```calc
int(x*sin(x), x) -> ?
int(e^(-x^2), x, -∞, ∞) -> ?
lim(sin(x)/x, x, 0) -> ?
lim(1/x, x, 0, "+") -> ?
sin(x) -> series(x, 6) -> ?
x^2 - 1 -> factor -> ?
x^3 - 6*x^2 + 11*x - 6 -> solve(x) -> ?
x^2 + 1 -> solve(x) -> ?
1/(s^2 + 1) -> invlaplace(s) -> ?
sqrt(x^2) -> assume(x > 0) -> simplify -> ?
```
